{"id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-oracle-program-semantics.md","title":"Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine","display":"df-oracle-turing-machine — Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","aliases":["73-df-oracle-program-semantics","73-df-oracle-turing-machine"],"display":"df-oracle-turing-machine — Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-oracle-program-semantics</span><span>73-df-oracle-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-turing-machine — Deterministic Oracle Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (binary alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (oracle language)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (head directions and displacements, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}\\)</span> (reflexive transitive closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{wordenc})\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}(\\operatorname{wordenc})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(\\mathsf L)=0,\\iota(\\mathsf R)=1\">\\(\\iota(\\mathsf L)=0,\\iota(\\mathsf R)=1\\)</span> (fixed tuple and direction codes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lex}\">\\(\\mathrm{lex}\\)</span> (the lexicographic order on finite tuples of natural numbers)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\)</span> (canonical finite oracle-program descriptions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{ocode},\\operatorname{odecode})\">\\(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{ocode},\\operatorname{odecode})\\)</span> (oracle-program coding package)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在配置和运行子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\">\\(O=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\">\\(\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\)</span>；分量均为其唯一投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。不规范查询配置没有神谕后继，既不被自动接受也不被自动拒绝。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OTM}_{B}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl(\nO=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\mathbf 2\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\n\\land\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}|=6\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OTM}_{B}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl(\nO=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land 0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{blank}\\in\\Gamma\\land\\mathbf 2\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{blank}\\}\n\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\n\\to Q\\times\\Gamma^k\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\n\\land\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}\\subseteq Q\n\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\}|=6\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g,k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl[\nr\\geq6\\land g\\geq3\\land k\\geq2\n\\land O=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\nq_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land\\operatorname{OTM}_{B}(O)\n\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\n\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g,k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\;\\Bigl[\nr\\geq6\\land g\\geq3\\land k\\geq2\n\\land O=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\nq_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}})\n\\land\\operatorname{OTM}_{B}(O)\n\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\n\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\coloneqq\n\\{O:\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\coloneqq\n\\{O:\\operatorname{CanonOTM}(O)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OTableCode}(O,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g,k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\,\n\\exists\\bigl((q_i,\\mathbf a_i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{(r-3)g^k}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\n\\land O=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\nq_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}),\\\\\nQ=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\},\\\\\n\\bigl((q_i,\\mathbf a_i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{(r-3)g^k}\n=\\bigl\\langle(q,\\mathbf a):(q,\\mathbf a)\\in\n(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}}\\})\n\\times\\Gamma^k\\bigr\\rangle_{\\mathrm{lex}},\\\\\n\\tau=\\langle r,g,k,\\mathrm{blank},q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}\\limits_{i=1}^{(r-3)g^k}\n\\left(\n\\langle\\pi_1\\delta(q_i,\\mathbf a_i)\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\pi_j(\\pi_2(\\delta(q_i,\\mathbf a_i))):1\\leq j\\leq k\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\iota(\\pi_j(\\pi_3(\\delta(q_i,\\mathbf a_i)))):1\\leq j\\leq k\\rangle\n\\right)\n\\end{array}\n\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OTableCode}(O,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g,k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}},\nq_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}\\,\n\\exists\\bigl((q_i,\\mathbf a_i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{(r-3)g^k}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\n\\land O=(Q,\\mathbf 2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},\nq_{\\mathsf{rej}},q_{\\mathsf{qry}},q_{\\mathsf{yes}},q_{\\mathsf{no}}),\\\\\nQ=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\lan